('OS-001','OS','Processes','EASY','MCQ','Which is shared between threads of the same process?','[{"id":"A","text":"Stack"},{"id":"B","text":"Registers"},{"id":"C","text":"Heap memory"},{"id":"D","text":"Program counter"}]','C','Threads share the heap and globals but each has its own stack, registers and program counter.',NULL,NULL,45,1,TRUE),
('OS-002','OS','Scheduling','MEDIUM','MCQ','Which scheduling algorithm is optimal for minimizing average waiting time when burst times are known?','[{"id":"A","text":"Round robin"},{"id":"B","text":"FCFS"},{"id":"C","text":"Shortest Job First"},{"id":"D","text":"Priority with aging"}]','C','SJF minimizes average waiting time for a given set of jobs (non-preemptive).',NULL,NULL,60,1,TRUE),
