('OS-005','OS','Synchronization','MEDIUM','MCQ','What is the key difference between a mutex and a binary semaphore?','[{"id":"A","text":"There is none"},{"id":"B","text":"A mutex has ownership: only the locker should unlock it"},{"id":"C","text":"A semaphore cannot be shared"},{"id":"D","text":"A mutex can count above one"}]','B','Mutexes are owned by the thread that locked them; semaphores are signalling mechanisms without ownership.',NULL,NULL,60,1,TRUE),
